Three depth layers (far, mid, and near) are configured for scene 8 with distinct scale, blur, and pace settings. Floater lifecycle hooks (`mount`, `integrate`, and `place`) manage layer assignment, physics continuation, and DOM style application without changing layout coordinates, keep-out bounds, replacement cadence, or circular geometry.

